# Everything the build re-creates or must never reach the image. Without this the COPY of the
# repo drags the host's node_modules and .next in, which defeats the point of the multi-stage
# build and can smuggle a darwin-arm64 binary into a linux image.
node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
dist
**/dist
.turbo
**/.turbo
.git
.github
.vscode
.agents
.claude
docs
**/*.md
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
